openmediavault-qnapx39 (7.1.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Front panel LEDs on the TS-639 Pro (IT8718F GPIO): Status solid green
    when all is well, red on a failed fan, a failed disk or a degraded
    RAID; the failed disk's bay LED lights red. The BIOS state is put
    back when the service stops.
  * Tools to dump and probe the IT8718F GPIO pins on other models.

 -- Rui <zrcz180@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:27:13 -0000

openmediavault-qnapx39 (7.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * First release: fan control for the QNAP TS-639 Pro (IT8718F, it87)
    on OpenMediaVault 7: fan curve from CPU, board and disk
    temperatures, full speed on any failure, status page, dashboard
    gauges and performance graphs.

 -- Rui <zrcz180@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:55:21 +0000
